{"type":"standard","title":"Dina Titus","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Dina Titus</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q524440","titles":{"canonical":"Dina_Titus","normalized":"Dina Titus","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Dina Titus</span></span>"},"pageid":2495543,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Dina_Titus_official_photo.jpg/330px-Dina_Titus_official_photo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":399},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Dina_Titus_official_photo.jpg/3840px-Dina_Titus_official_photo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":5959,"height":7200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375361554","tid":"e273e961-b280-11f1-b502-b38f3f19ac15","timestamp":"2026-09-17T10:16:45Z","description":"American politician (born 1950)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dina_Titus","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dina_Titus?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dina_Titus?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Dina_Titus"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dina_Titus","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Dina_Titus","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dina_Titus?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Dina_Titus"}},"extract":"Alice Constandina \"Dina\" Titus is an American politician who has been the United States representative for Nevada's 1st congressional district since 2013. Previously, she served as the U.S. representative for Nevada's 3rd congressional district from 2009 to 2011. Titus is a member of the Democratic Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>Alice Constandina</b> \"<b>Dina</b>\" <b>Titus</b> is an American politician who has been the United States representative for Nevada's 1st congressional district since 2013. Previously, she served as the U.S. representative for Nevada's 3rd congressional district from 2009 to 2011. Titus is a member of the Democratic Party.</p>"}